        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9039P, Omnia Ultima 9039P Hex Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 12 inch or 18 inch lengths, the Hex Door Pull is a study in modern design. This contemporary door handle is exquisitely designed with attention to comfort and quality that you demand for your home. The Omnia Ultima 9039P Hex Pull is available in a wide range of modern finishes.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Hexagon Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9039P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9039P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9039P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/hex-back-to-back-pulls-pair-omnia-btb-9039p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
